{"step_index":87,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T13:29:41Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-10T16:29:41+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-10T16:29:41+03:00\nCommand exited with code 0.\n\nCommand output:\ncommit 678cb5c390d2e041e3d96f44471b24f9c00254b1\r\nAuthor: v.smirnov <v.smirnov@gigab2b.ru>\r\nDate:   Tue Nov 3 22:13:30 2026 +0300\r\n\r\n    Mac: catch-up finds undated live text; times and reactions in live text\r\n    \r\n    Catch-up placed live text only by the provider's createdAt. Lines without\r\n    it (or with a seconds or differently named timestamp) were never inside any\r\n    sound-off period, so catch-up showed \"No transcript\" although live text had\r\n    lines for that time.\r\n    \r\n    - Live chat and transcript events record when they arrived. A line is placed\r\n      by the provider's time when it agrees with arrival (within 10 minutes),\r\n      otherwise by arrival; history pages keep provider time only.\r\n    - Provider times are read from createdAt, timestamp, startTime, startedAt or\r\n      time, in seconds or milliseconds; pre-2020 values count as absent.\r\n    - The first live transcript event logs its field names (no content).\r\n    - Live text shows a time on each line and lists reactions among the lines;\r\n      catch-up periods show line times and the reactions sent in them. Chat\r\n      messages without a provider time sort by arrival.\r\n    \r\n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\r\n\r\n Experiments/NativeGuest/GuestMeetingFeatures.swift | 35 ++++++++++++++------\r\n .../NativeGuestTests/MeetingFeaturesTests.swift    |  7 ++++\r\n NativeMacGuest/DesktopMeetingModel.swift           | 37 ++++++++++++++++++++--\r\n NativeMacGuest/DesktopMeetingView.swift            | 32 +++++++++++++++++--\r\n .../Tests/Parity/DesktopParityTests.swift          | 24 ++++++++++++++\r\n RockNRoll/en.lproj/Localizable.strings             |  1 +\r\n RockNRoll/ru.lproj/Localizable.strings             |  1 +\r\n 7 files changed, 123 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)\r\n"}
